  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate shot Investor Coalition (CLIC) - a global coalition driving investment in sustainable agriculture and food systems.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build on a portfolio of innovative and cutting edge digital interventions for agriculture and climate advisory services that were started under the Enhancing Digital and Innovation for Agri-Food Systems and Livelihoods (EDIAL) programme and expanded under the Delivering Agriculture Breakthrough programme.  The portfolio will build on the successful digital agriculture partnership with Gates Foundation and expand this into Artificial Intelligence (AI)-focused innovations, including through a project aimed at collating, cleansing and operationalising satellite data through machine learning for smallholder farmers.  The portfolio also includes expanding innovative work to deliver digital agriculture advisory services for farmers that was trialled in Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
